  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dryness</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A rich body cream that nourishes the skin while treating the senses.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Family: </strong>Fresh</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh Citrus & Fruits</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Key Notes: </strong>Guava Nectar, Pink Strawberry, Pear Blossom</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, phthalates, and sulfates SLS & SLES. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-On dry skin, massage all over your body for rich, comforting moisture. <br>-Wear each scent on its own, or pair the balm and mist together in Vanilla (sold separately), Pink Guava or Pistachio Milk (sold separately) for a layered fragrance.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Water/Aqua/Eau, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Oil, Propanediol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Dipentaerythrityl Hexa C5-9 Acid Esters, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cetearyl Olivate, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Diisostearyl Malate, Astrocaryum Murumuru Seed Butter, Shorea Stenoptera Seed Butter, Ceramide NP, Phytosphingosine, Squalane, Arginine, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Oil, Brassica Campestris (Rapeseed) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Sorbitan Olivate, Polysorbate 60, Hydroxyacetophenone, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Caprylyl Glycol, Tromethamine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Behenyl Alcohol, Arachidyl Alcohol, Triethylhexanoin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Arachidyl Glucoside, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Glyceryl Stearate, Stearic Acid, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Carbomer, Fragrance (Parfum), Linalool, Vanillin, Limonene, Citrus Aurantium Peel Oil, Terpineol, Dimethyl Phenethyl Acetate, Benzyl Alcohol.</div></details>",
